.TH OSC52COPY 1 "August 2026" "osc52copy 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
osc52copy \- copy text using OSC 52
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B osc52copy
.RI [ TEXT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B osc52copy
copies its arguments, or standard input when no arguments are given, to the
terminal clipboard using an OSC 52 sequence.
It is equivalent to
.BR "osc52 copy" .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Show usage information.
.TP
.BR -v , " --version"
Show the version number.
